<title>USA: Stephens Inc wins New Orleans, La., $50 mln issue.</title>
<headline>Stephens Inc wins New Orleans, La., $50 mln issue.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stephens Inc said it won $50 million of New Orleans, La., public improvement bonds, issue of 1997-A, with a true interest cost of (TIC) of 5.76 percent.</p>
</text>
